{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE HISTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a <strong>gaucho</strong> in the South American fight for independence in 1822 and consume your enemies' fear to transform into the Zupay, a demonic legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gaucho tried to live a peaceful life after years of fighting in the <strong>independence war</strong>\u00a0along the northern border. When the enemy breaks into his life and leaves his village <i>besieged and devastated</i>, The Gaucho is possessed by a Native American myth, <strong>The Zupay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in the search for <strong>revenge</strong>, this creature pulls him back to <i>the violent life he thought was over.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/bd9c954f23ddf8f088401b289231f65c.poster.avif?t=1760475099\" width=480 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/bd9c954f23ddf8f088401b289231f65c.webm?t=1760475099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/bd9c954f23ddf8f088401b289231f65c.mp4?t=1760475099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/d8f1dcdb35a7336e802ff15ec514d154.webp?t=1760475099\" width=480 height=41 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTURE AWAITS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> royalists in your path for revenge! Prove your <strong>skills</strong> while facing different kinds of foes standing in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>stealth</strong> to take them down! Sometimes staying low is the best way to <strong>overcome</strong> the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/954c9bf7b2869a35e3bc8e6c32cb2ce9.poster.avif?t=1760475099\" width=480 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/954c9bf7b2869a35e3bc8e6c32cb2ce9.webm?t=1760475099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/954c9bf7b2869a35e3bc8e6c32cb2ce9.mp4?t=1760475099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather\u00a0<strong>resources</strong> that will help you in your journey! Look for money and special herbs to <strong>boost\u00a0yourself</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Find smart ways to\u00a0frighten</strong> your enemies!<strong> Consume their fear </strong>to awake the devil inside you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the <strong>Zupay</strong>! Bring out chaos by transforming into an <strong>unstoppable beast</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/08d8cf4d687c529a999ea71bf1149f4a.poster.avif?t=1760475099\" width=480 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/08d8cf4d687c529a999ea71bf1149f4a.webm?t=1760475099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/08d8cf4d687c529a999ea71bf1149f4a.mp4?t=1760475099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/0d6531f62bbc88c919f8c86e8fa37849.webp?t=1760475099\" width=480 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore territories, face challenges and fight until your last breath <u>to defend your homeland.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you just seeking revenge? Or is there something bigger than you to fight for?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074370?t=1760475099","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074370?t=1760475099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/983b1b50d74ddd768140bacc544048cba82e039b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760475099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/983b1b50d74ddd768140bacc544048cba82e039b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760475099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE HISTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a <strong>gaucho</strong> in the South American fight for independence in 1822 and consume your enemies' fear to transform into the Zupay, a demonic legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gaucho tried to live a peaceful life after years of fighting in the <strong>independence war</strong>\u00a0along the northern border. When the enemy breaks into his life and leaves his village <i>besieged and devastated</i>, 